'''Diantha''' (Japanese: '''カルネ''' ''Carne'') is a {{TCGP|Supporter}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Supporter
|rule=SWSH Supporter
|effect=Heal 90 damage from 1 of your {{e|Psychic}} Pokémon that has 2 or more {{e|Psychic}} Energy attached. If you healed any damage in this way, discard 2 {{e|Psychic}} Energy from that Pokémon.
}}

